 dresse-t-il sur la route{SAUT}de notre amour? Ahaha... J'ai toujours{SAUT}rêvé de dire ça!(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0597", "bloc": "YOUEN.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "  Oh, I'm sorry... I'm okay now."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "Oh, pardon... Ça va mieux, maintenant."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "  Oh, I'm sorry... I'm okay now.(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "Oh, pardon... Ça va mieux, maintenant.(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0598", "bloc": "YOUEN.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": " Nooooo! I'm scaaared!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "Nooooon! J'ai peuuuur!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": " Nooooo! I'm scaaared!(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "Nooooon! J'ai peuuuur!(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0599", "bloc": "YOUEN.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "  A-Ahahaha...!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "A-Ahahaha...!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "  A-Ahahaha...!(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "A-Ahahaha...!(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0600", "bloc": "YOUEN.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "  Where's that confidence coming from?"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "Then again, it's better that than a man"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "who has no confidence at all."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "D'où te vient cette assurance?"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "Remarque, ça vaut mieux qu'un homme"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "sans aucune confiance en lui."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "  Where's that confidence coming from?{SAUT}Then again, it's better that than a man{SAUT}who has no confidence at all.(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "D'où te vient cette assurance?{SAUT}Remarqu